# Marketing pages

- `/` is for seekers. `/for-providers` is secondary. Do not make them equal in the hero.
- Feature routes live under `/features/[slug]`. Keep the nav Features menu in `lib/site.ts` as the source of truth.
- Every feature named in the PRD gets a page: matcher, parking, deadlines, letters, savings, help, income, privacy, quiet.
- Lead with a real photo from `lib/photos.ts`, not an icon grid. Icons (Tabler) support photos; they do not replace them.
- Sign-in is a **dialog**, opened from the header and CTAs. Do not add a standalone marketing login page unless auth needs a redirect URL.
- Theme toggle is present and quiet — never a hero control. Default is system.
- Light and dark must both work. Test overlays so type stays readable on photos.
